{"Business": {"expires_at": 1785197407.495425, "feed": {"family": "Business", "fetched_at": "2026-07-27T18:10:07+00:00", "items": [{"title": "2026 AI Global Jobs Barometer", "source": "PwC", "url": "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFFT1tmHDa8cUAiQyi8hjpmzW80CtnOdUUxJGr4_t9qX6AfqmmtDUW_b_g5ucZO5q4Q-BsyRIh4ps5OX0L3njPnTFZo8sWj63u58XQxzanMG9K_he6vZyRWiQzH54TqhUi37RjLr-YDBnvKEx4w_3SYOsdm_kU84g==", "published": "2026-06-15", "summary": "PwC's global study reveals a two-track labor market where AI \"professionalizes\" certain business roles, leading to twice the job growth and 42% higher wage increases compared to roles being automated. Furthermore, the study highlights that early-career, AI-exposed junior business roles are 7 times more likely to require traditionally senior-level skills like leadership and advanced judgment.", "image": null, "favicon": "https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=pwc.com&sz=64"}, {"title": "Surging AI Demand in Professional Services", "source": "Bipartisan Policy Center", "url": "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFV0yZi70f433lIGONkLOddwGY_NzkQvxZEU_ytSzqc3rZXRSThYDnpQvXY5_Mtb04-dvwTrWVQkoFirZ4EksBJT6yvMSk66HCj0r7l5xEXqP8dT5C0murNFNoQbGx2jNZzg5IkliEjDApkGLdvmSHWkzZetkApQC9HkaS_JlpuFLxs2pBomy-4EdDwHIHS52425Xtq4QFm4yMalX0mkJokEZfFJQM=", "published": "2026-07-15", "summary": "Utilizing data from Lightcast, this analysis shows that the rapid demand for advanced AI skills is shifting away from tech companies and exploding into professional business services. Employment placement agencies saw a 69% year-over-year increase in AI-skilled job postings, and Certified Public Accountant (CPA) offices experienced a 55% surge, signaling that traditional business fields are now aggressively hiring for AI capabilities.", "image": null, "favicon": "https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=bipartisanpolicy.org&sz=64"}, {"title": "What AI Skills Do Employers Actually Look For in 2026?", 