search.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHVG8j85v8Mq_I-Mp3GCjt6OneWGmctZy1yfp_3IIvQwaRkfxYD99CLoCHlAg6NJWqnACVCLw4dOeYSUaAtNZvr9_S5KLNbeYIEgRpXq3S6Jw8VgzOYZGoEE3TKEt35GC4Dgn9RxYK_CPg7-HNHVdTUJD68Ape3_og70S5iNNyrqVVsesYM_Gh3K8n0Qmum6LiiVlJIaO50xniJiOo0kQOQTiD3", "published": "2026-07-16", "summary": "Rapid AI integration is driving a projected 40% growth in AI-focused healthcare positions over the next five years, elevating traditional health information management roles into specialized positions like AI Data Specialists and Clinical Informatics Analysts.", "image": null, "favicon": "https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=research.com&sz=64"}, {"title": "Healthcare AI Hiring Trends 2026", "source": "KORE1", "url": "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHu4pZh-vE8DMAMr1aztUWZ10HbttojX4ork5IToQ8T24QN3yBcF9eJhYG0DtcbES-Vhy7ZvJOeEEyB9uYnQIh_iKVa4j45vzqLo2uDcth0dlfHrr5x8hTd5ptAlkm6MK3H1-WznqkZTfTPkw==", "published": "2026-05-17", "summary": "Healthcare IT staffing data shows a massive 2.4-fold year-over-year increase in AI-related searches, heavily driven by health systems hiring ambient clinical AI engineers to implement automated documentation software and reduce clinician burnout.", "image": "https://www.kore1.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Kore1-Social-Posts-73.webp", "favicon": "https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=kore1.com&sz=64"}]}}, "Arts": {"expires_at": 1785197409.4111319, "feed": {"family": "Arts", "fetched_at": "2026-07-27T18:10:09+00:00", "items": [{"title": "Why Humanities Majors Are 2026\u2019s Stealth Power Players In Tech", "source": "Forbes", "url": "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF15o1Xw6rrp5-MHwi6qNErmCoA_H1LfZGR_DeDvJQK17PTym1Cx7KY1Foe7VMj9b-Lx_yCGdlRO01J0-A4ulspkQkDopW8cEXng4toMyW4bIFff0E6PmA9TK2yIhpO2m8sU24ICL9w7UkiGEJ-vWZc_46Ut8Mx26kwconvK8PXpN9GjQVve3kB2UuoQWcsjIYnnyMadO5I1kdfJBOoOJsOq_aNYawd0_El9w==", "published": "2026-07-26", "summary": "As generative AI increasingly automates technical tasks like coding, the tech sector is seeing a surge in demand for English and social science majors who possess strong storytelling, branding, and persuasion skills. These humanities graduates are highly valued for their high \"versatility quotient\" and their ability to bridge the \"AI translation gap\" by bringing human empathy and context to technical concepts.", "image": "https://imageio.forbes.com/specials-images/imageserve/6a6309a6a90d2729eacafbb7/0x0.jpg?format=jpg&height=900&width=1600&fit=bounds", "favicon": "https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=forbes.com&sz=64"}, {"title": "Digital Innovation Reshaping Art Career Salaries and Demands", "source": "Research.com", "url": "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFoFqYh-J-8PDd-vnjjzVpnz-nZ5D3-FcpazxxQOK3hUH5iSf7uGAbsShfa9Xx9u1BnGtJFpcdEQkYCbJnfhGx4MSrh4j0MPlzoP8KlFJ7AvpyxuVQExr8hRDIzIC86Lcz7lKfFYL-JPkMQ6Rr2kGrb8Zk48wDzM34J7VGK0YjngfY4Xtfj5LR6zvc2UvvhutbN", "published": "2026-07-16", "summary": "While routine and conventional art-making processes face automation pressure, there is an expanding 15% projected growth in creative digital media industries for art graduates who can combine interdisciplinary artistic creativity with AI-driven tools. This shift has created specialized, higher-paying roles\u2014such as AI art technologists and digital innovation strategists\u2014for artists who learn to use AI tools efficiently.", "image": null, "favicon": "https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=research.com&sz=64"}, {"title": "Growing Enterprise Demand for Ethical AI and Humanities Skills", "source": "Research.com", "url": "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFoFqYh-J-8PDd-vnjjzVpnz-nZ5D3-FcpazxxQOK3hUH5iSf7uGAbsShfa9Xx9u1BnGtJFpcdEQkYCbJnfhGx4MSrh4j0MPlzoP8KlFJ7AvpyxuVQExr8hRDIzIC86Lcz7lKfFYL-JPkMQ6Rr2kGrb8Zk48wDzM34J7VGK0YjngfY4Xtfj5LR6zvc2UvvhutbN", "published": "2026-07-16", "summary": "Technology companies are increasingly hiring humanities majors for ethical AI development, ethical storytelling, and digital humanities roles, leading to a 30% growth in these targeted sectors over the past five years. Employers are looking for graduates who can analyze, interpret, and ethically guide AI-generated information rather than just generate raw data.", "image": null, "favicon": "https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=research.com&sz=64"}]}}, "Humanities": {"expires_at": 1785197380.1932821, "feed": {"family": "Humanities", "fetched_at": "2026-07-27T18:09:40+00:00", "items": [{"title": "Why Humanities Majors Are 2026\u2019s Stealth Power Players In Tech", "source": "Forbes", "url": "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFMZule3ovdzDxXvd3XLhFT6QaeYXorQ4dFkTaTVVJpJvY3lBeNNttogACHRELji4HODP3n5-kg3w0ROpmq79agSfjakB50d4T0aYt-jPeYI2NjV7PufrnBtAsAGVMy6Cz4Kc46Z1BRjLG6NZ4CpTAaL55n0YulD6QCxlOQjPZhjifLj8sOfjkIKuXzXI4an43O0d5OdsUByEvHzYvORrMSUgbQUn8LrJUKGg==", "published": "2026-07-26", "summary": "As generative AI automates technical and coding tasks, the tech industry is experiencing a surge in demand for the \"narrative edge\"\u2014the ability to build brands, persuade, and tell compelling stories. LinkedIn workforce data reveals that English and social science majors are now finding clearer pathways into the tech sector than specialized junior engineers, as companies look to humanities graduates to bridge the \"AI translation gap\" and provide context and emotional resonance that machines cannot replicate.", "image": "https://imageio.forbes.com/specials-images/imageserve/6a6309a6a90d2729eacafbb7/0x0.jpg?format=jpg&height=900&width=1600&fit=bounds", "favicon": "https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=forbes.com&sz=64"}, {"title": "How to get tech jobs with an Arts degree: Google DeepMind and Anthropic hiring humanities students for AI jobs", "source": "The Times of India", "url": "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEYMiJoxgP8Z4dy6mm1xroO5ZWSJhr2Qb-226r6Cx7ZWG7ydz-NzF1Ih4dVX1I5vCMFEZZklxazWhzg7iQAdiflvh8U0EkyjdU49AVBjffr2mJD6i6aMRspr72kz2E-aYYwCoWM4oyv0aln6U40mxKEuIc9BAqjjq3EEjBrduWVho6-WuzZAn13R7M60bL0fAV4qqOu1713wNSC2oX0vdWf2yUw1-kw_pB4dNhwZEAuY6sCw9qxJAbzRiZXvIlS10WW1PHkzo7rUEk1EYEnLofm70H9pJEKWeoC4GX2vUiZM9o0E-9u6HrsK1tW5ZnPbc9C7lkau2Y=", "published": "2026-06-05", "summary": "Tech giants like Google DeepMind and Anthropic are actively hiring arts and humanities students (including philosophers, ethicists, and social scientists). AI developers are realizing that building powerful systems is not enough; they must be safe, fair, and aligned with human values\u2014shifting the recruitment focus toward students who understand people and ethics rather than just coding.", "image": "https://static.toiimg.com/thumb/msid-131531155,width-1280,height-720,resizemode-6,overlay-toi_sw,pt-32,y_pad-600/photo.jpg", "favicon": "https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=timesofindia.indiatimes.com&sz=64"}, {"title": "Automation Shifts the Focus of Humanities Roles to High-Level Specialization", "source": "Research.com", "url": "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF9jVa9LEvVUwkPzR9_9HmFz1fYibd7kmqBFFEdB_S86edFuDsg6bNsuOsDuAIfO2DHHOy5uFZvD2NTo6X9R9xw8wzeOpTpVGqNHhmzBbtiCs0oly0xe6czOn7dNyv6KaahmLdXkU82n-eOP5qLRAALbq0gII5yG1qmbcWAvm7xiNR7CA_soGH6Q5tLpWZX2xc=", "published": "2026-07-16", "summary": "While research indicates that up to 45% of tasks in humanities-related occupations (such as entry-level content drafting in media and communications) face automation, this shift is actually pushing the workforce toward high-level specialization, digital literacy, and ethical storytelling. The integration of AI tools is allowing humanities graduates to move away from routine tasks and focus on critical analysis, adaptive communication, and interdisciplinary leadership.", "image": null, "favicon": "https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=research.com&sz=64"}]}}, "Social sci": {"expires_at": 1785197410.3206558, "feed": {"family": "Social sci", "fetched_at": "2026-07-27T18:10:10+00:00", "items": [{"title": "Why Humanities Majors Are 2026\u2019s Stealth Power Players In Tech", "source": "Forbes", "url": "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFJfHzuj452H43QFRkHw9ogr4-CoS7MYZXjh8FMl5-KuzvXUcTTp8XyS4issfJwHRnwdtvaUqEEHSEblU-E1Idxjk3KL-9L6Tz7Ir01dl0y-fDVjC93X2Wr1oRjsOkQIGuVI561uZgeqvjgySzJ6I4g9jfm6KNoCFABbQyNWJuBShc_hr-qzcbxWexqqmq0Hr5dhBPdQCaOf5Tk1kU9ybmn5YGXQ-ZzNphE6g==", "published": "2026-07-26", "summary": "As generative AI automates routine technical tasks like coding, a shift toward a \"narrative edge era\" has emerged, where employers increasingly value human-centric skills like branding, persuasion, and storytelling. Recent LinkedIn workforce data reveals that social science and English majors are finding clearer hiring pathways in the tech sector than specialized junior engineers, as these graduates are uniquely skilled at bridging the \"AI translation gap\" and conveying technical concepts to diverse stakeholders.", "image": "https://imageio.forbes.com/specials-images/imageserve/6a6309a6a90d2729eacafbb7/0x0.jpg?format=jpg&height=900&width=1600&fit=bounds", "favicon": "https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=forbes.com&sz=64"}, {"title": "AI Drives Job Re-specialization and Ethical Roles in Sociology", "source": "Research.com", "url": "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHBeTEfH4Q2v1EX2pHW9t_UCdA-BC5gsO9ZOxHigT9pMhiCJAQ7DjN7tkJ9ZDH0bZqZ1jhU0wRcyfUCRlepz9YfwcX5AyfPm_ALulw4mdOXfhBQE8csWRlcHd3VeHm6I83owN-nnZAhugiEaBpOsh1488p6Mul0AJ8y1lLRwOT3Pb5OhpumHUgq12LtgD0N1Q==", "published": "2026-07-16", "summary": "While approximately 30% of tasks in the social sciences face moderate-to-high automation risks (such as routine data collection and database entry), AI is driving career specialization by automating data analysis so professionals can focus on deeper policy development and interpretation. Consequently, roughly 45% of sociology-related jobs now require proficiency in AI-enhanced data interpretation, prompting a growing demand for social science graduates who can navigate complex cultural and ethical considerations in AI deployment.", "image": null, "favicon": "https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=research.com&sz=64"}, {"title": "Employers Leverage Entry-Level AI Fluency and Highlight Interdisciplinary Adaptability", "source": "Handshake", "url": "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEKVcRCBQYCCfeH9zp1_c_AulHQI2pHCbZSZ3sj10tlBW7djFYczdUJpy9Iel362eedsUp9gsId-H9kLaZHvw_L4hbZjVgjgeMcBUkZUgA5ErtAdNEKi_IHA5lzeXkEIUUFErTIPWPMqK1a_dLajRRVcTLGDKiEw6D6SaWCxZ3uyyFH4nQuJF7rODi0R5rUwU6O5_UDcJ4obvyCL5tG6Jl4MWeBdA==", "published": null, "summary": "Handshake\u2019s 2026 early talent data highlights that while nearly half of pessimistic college seniors worry about AI's impact on their career prospects, students\u2014including those in the social sciences\u2014are adding AI skills to their resumes at twice the rate of previous years. Over 80% of hiring managers now view comfort with AI for research, brainstorming, and communication as a crucial entry-level skill, signaling that social science graduates who combine traditional critical thinking with AI tools are highly competitive.", "image": null, "favicon": "https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=joinhandshake.com&sz=64"}]}}, "STEM": {"expires_at": 1785197408.126514, "feed": {"family": "STEM", "fetched_at": "2026-07-27T18:10:08+00:00", "items": [{"title": "Undergraduate Shifts to \"AI-Resistant\" Majors", "source": "Academic Jobs", "url": "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHGCy8lsnv_Ie9DUwqS7WfakVPQ7vkG3arpqfJq7Sy-pNHoDkvral0fGBcR6SDPY8uQ109KOQw1SAOS9lXVysX5oRp2r22OrRYl3QTxa1uMxdaggKTiwIL2MS0dbRAawZu0szi1AMTkcOO7sZ1GZyzWqCzrXYyiNroLDQ0OyBaNW_w56svcanorZWF2yD6qwaRfSNASLBeFvd8OgZH__C6suG4Mdswof_AmWhv5RxbKx5yt5gF-Fw==", "publishe