{"Business": {"expires_at": 1785206836.8339899, "feed": {"family": "Business", "fetched_at": "2026-07-27T20:47:16+00:00", "items": [{"title": "Industries with the Fastest Growth in Demand for AI Skills July 2026", "source": "Bipartisan Policy Center (BPC)", "url": "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFC39863zSuFWlX5oACiw_7hBeDDzwdIXImttwePXep022MCygcHzbVpEWUf4bXcs2W6zVdAOIaSKo0iFvOgqo8riVry6XMBW7yJvjBXgbZfik-R7JQ6cxt8GX4yasiVeOohE2RB1_PelAP6-1kuGWWp5wWiUkb79gLjIPZTHp2LeIploIQI4k_Koa-dYIjB-S9BPUkCl4U-ewYYjk_yX4NuRIi4Co=", "published": "2026-07-15", "summary": "Using employment analytics data, BPC reported that the fastest growth in AI job skill demand is shifting away from the technology sector and into professional services. Notably, job postings requiring AI skills saw a 55% year-over-year increase for Certified Public Accountants (CPAs) and a 69% increase for employment placement agencies, signaling that traditional business fields are actively seeking AI-literate talent.", "image": "https://bipartisanpolicy.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/shutterstock_2401946057_ai_workforce_economy-scaled-1.jpg", "favicon": "https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=bipartisanpolicy.org&sz=64"}, {"title": "The Rise of a \"Two-Track\" Labor Market Placing Premium on Leadership Skills", "source": "PwC (2026 Global AI Jobs Barometer)", "url": "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGFOD15RfX7tYUyR0eLE2Ull8rALHLA-VuFFHHxBseSVr3L3_moGtrBYco2cqyZJ3rGMVUnl9dQ760lSN6SX9aazv0sC06dZlZCEjawNkpNXQgCsgt2LQQLqmekw-YeZMDUO3A49EQvb1oa9mW6DLTEr2dQi_OvnQ==", "published": null, "summary": "PwC's analysis of over one billion global job ads shows that AI is creating a two-track labor market where technical \"democratization\" allows non-experts to use advanced tools, making soft business skills like strategic judgment, leadership, and policy governance far more critical and highly compensated.", "image": null, "favicon": "https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=pwc.com&sz=64"}, {"title": "AI Isn\u2019t Coming for Your Job Yet", "source": "The Futurum Group", "url": "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGN53f95LAuljmUi-T6Y-NEV4LCCb6cib3ZRoUIO_thYgdT3C3mGaCV5YklRdj65rntKkdBKGVwKdASb5Tn8gFlryB33i9Ji4f_r0nCR17jCKx_eVsfiIaztLOF6TN1E6rABE7vq4iDKaz9mNUJJSzz02tvdIBHsj8o-AZno6nrt5S2Qsxep8CUwCsIGLZwrt6Bdw==", "published": "2026-07-22", "summary": "While overall macroeconomic job loss from AI is not happening, enterprise hiring patterns show a clear slowdown\u2014about 47% of tech and business leaders report that AI adoption is slowing their near-term recruitment\u2014as organizations pause to integrate the technology and restructure career ladders for entry-level roles.", "image": "https://futurumgroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/AI-Isnt-Coming-for-Your-Job-Yet-\u2013-and-Maybe-Never-Will-1024x576.png", "favicon": "https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=futurumgroup.com&sz=64"}]}}, "STEM": {"expires_at": 1785206843.615076, "feed": {"family": "STEM", "fetched_at": "2026-07-27T20:47:23+00:00", "items": [{"title": "Computer Science Graduates Face Uncertain Job Market Amid AI Rise", "source": "The Washington Post", "url": "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHmkfMRozTsC92bnhYftAnheljEKGvE_g4-0QpaF1YXP_w-i1Suq6YwPuTY9ZAUl_VwlMv2SZRuzlQSlfty9xwwcEtkfZlzGt_dpLAFzOEalDZtPnuKlZWxzNLkP4wV0Mk1XB13NsHzEbO2qX326R70pJtoifWBVBSOf5QgP4hUUqVmUtv0UYqRRawWEXlFeVR-246oT0CnhURWzT82NoY6K7_KNW7YiFJtIxwVZlpsLGeDOoXpL1Qx", "published": "2026-05-20", "summary": "Recent computer science graduates are entering a highly uncertain job market where young software coders are predicted to be among the first impacted by AI-driven task automation. New STEM graduates are having to aggressively pivot, change their career expectations, and continuously reinvent their technical skills to remain competitive.", "image": null, "favicon": null}, {"title": "2026 The Future of AI Jobs for College Graduates", "source": "Research.com", "url": "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG2l3unxq6JjHK_lp-_UMKq0EAwPvh9ECCA-IJX5C059MkE87WGYA8a2j80k2WwOZEBQ0hILdwcCso5hwI8q9BlBlS7Gmw9btVV9zJ3k0i8iuklDvCi_2n3MbNdHEAAMCPsSt1XvW3dwuzt8d3OHoTjM-m5n5W_S7ERHA0Hwg9H1sesWgoPelG3BlX1SMaaCFFZUXrV2JEQ3lNXl_f558KHsvM=", "published": "2026-07-09", "summary": "By spring 2026, 35% of entry-level job postings for new college graduates specifically require AI-related skills, up from 12% in late 2025. While traditional coding roles face disruption, there is a projected 30% growth through 2029 for specialized AI fields, fueling demand for STEM graduates.", "image": null, "favicon": "https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=research.com&sz=64"}, {"title": "Impact of AI on Early", "source": "National Association of Colleges and Employers - NACE", "url": "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFqbUEXJ_f9rkofIwulssEfawF_j1z1pzWSWtlb75M_oGpnQI5GXQXjcWs4ePru7T2UQPpGJP-TzoNazstdRSZAtaWzCXGM6c5T6QBncvo1BaSacuzzOz6zleK70J9O7PngxEB3vGKm0l1lsGOyCO1HPAdSw7JK89RaRTG-OJERxXwTe_1zgPlAiyxuDZAtwPLgbd13D1wYiYNgBFWytZ66AnrlImv2", "published": "2026-05-13", "summary": "A 2026 survey highlights that while early-career workers feel prepared to use AI, 40% have changed or are considering changing their career plans due to the technology's influence. Over half of surveyed employers are actively discussing how AI can substitute for tasks traditionally performed by entry-level professionals.", "image": "https://www.naceweb.org/images/default-source/2026/feature/the-impact-of-ai-on-the-early-career-labor-market-xlarge.png?sfvrsn=75e158aa_1", "favicon": "https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=naceweb.org&sz=64"}]}}, "Health": {"expires_at": 1785206850.8016331, "feed": {"family": "Health", "fetched_at": "2026-07-27T20:47:30+00:00", "items": [{"title": "How AI Will Transform the Healthcare Workforce in 2026", "source": "DistilINFO Hospital IT", "url": "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFySDQCF8TYfRRpnter9oXif0ufZlUk2v_39z7VgZ5FlCSLJuVrKQjpKe6bq104xLBCcxpJbLsQw6lkuTaUEG0JKexXGvEwfNrV2f-__zv5a1BHF-O5zezS17cdmUHekNFa7K1YlsZyohO5mZ_pydCb6monTb0lpSLDPQ==", "published": "2026-07-15", "summary": "Recent survey data indicates that 46% of nurses are actively utilizing generative AI at work to reduce burnout by streamlining documentation and routine workflows, though a critical gap remains as only 22% of health systems have published formal AI governance policies or training requirements.", "image": "https://distilinfo.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/13114.jpg", "favicon": "https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=distilinfo.com&sz=64"}, {"title": "AI Reshapes Health Information Management (HIM)", "source": "Research.com", "url": "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFscafjxam5POd6ODMIovy3cID8mVqJanMCATfWj00mcB3RXiBYg92qUe9Xg7Sk6Ti6YCf17dkXNCbSrLdFYZ3MyXxinYKcNYu43Atg6IXbbZulsz8Mc9R9Y-9Xw7vUxjW9mVMDo66o7dYuSZCjGGW-CzErgi94JxjKnfNPXN8WL1gXGTcGIO9dhu7__r1qQSf2qXPxdc_uEjddzOSNZi4DFGKl", "published": "2026-07-16", "summary": "While routine data entry and manual claims processing roles are rapidly declining due to automation, demand is surging for specialized AI Data Specialists and Clinical Informatics Analysts\u2014with 60% of health information roles expected to integrate AI-driven tools within the next five years.", "image": null, "favicon": "https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=research.com&sz=64"}, {"title": "AI's Impact on Healthcare Recruitment and Job Seekers", "source": "Medical Economics", "url": "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFIthK6AmbbpKhePSv0HkIs0ifnOBuPNkApzXD7XWT0RWD64DFlrz2AU-sjiqGdeAauv5XmRlXXBdovne2KkwSyDLTGcV17bbPk2bIoFpeIpwYxoQV_2CMVnHGAIxnYA5pxuX2Q9mdaOBUxPYLQfMJEFPqXDID4ocqcSuIwLDSgI--hGYQ9ja-s4XY9jnZ3_eUl8oXo-_TtTg==", "published": "2026-03-31", "summary": "Drawing from insights of over 1.5 million healthcare workers, the report details how AI is transforming hiring, where algorithms accelerate candidate screening for recruiters while job-seeking health graduates use virtual career coaches and automated resume optimization to stand out.", "image": null, "favicon": "https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=medicaleconomics.com&sz=64"}]}}, "Social sci": {"expires_at": 1785206854.94281, "feed": {"family": "Social sci", "fetched_at": "2026-07-27T20:47:34+00:00", "items": [{"title": "Why Humanities Majors Are 2026\u2019s Stealth Power Players In Tech", "source": "Forbes", "url": "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFL-PTb-i1IbTyjNJIpb5CSuG9BEtOPZEcSEgZVW93d8I-AHu78jOcnVWcC89SHDxwFpB7gy3TuvlV2bJFaAxwwlG9gMo6yCjbIK3loGkWjoo9sYsyGHVinwncko6tJNPEcGMN158rHya_ksb4pWA6ZZDBdVKSjONg3q9RaVgw-xv_ah5ZZUct3yjcvZsvRfdvOI6HVOG_SCnCNnJmE6eoqrpvpBH5rn4B8", "published": "2026-07-26", "summary": "As generative AI increasingly automates technical tasks like coding, a \"narrative edge era\" has emerged where social science and English majors are seeing stronger hiring paths in tech due to their superior skills in stakeholder empathy, storytelling, and bridging the \"AI translation gap.\"", "image": "https://imageio.forbes.com/specials-images/imageserve/6a6309a6a90d2729eacafbb7/0x0.jpg?format=jpg&height=900&width=1600&fit=bounds", "favicon": "https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=forbes.com&sz=64"}, {"title": "AI Integration Driving Rise in Specialized Social Science Careers and Skill Gaps", "source": "Research.com", "url": "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEDSHLNAE100oLdJSnj3FMo3b-RmBUDvKimv_w6YtM0VNcTQ2u6ivO1dozfLyewNnJO49-j6vX7_snwKUvCf2DWlHCsUH-daeSvrDc3BOXbh5K4uU9PmK0miN2bJLJSviqgwQnazaoNWg6iDL1k-dlOKMIMfN6ZRpd9ijyswj-T-bBu-EaKIWJgZrv3kGLg", "published": "2026-07-16", "summary": "The integration of AI is reshaping sociology and social science careers, leading to a 15% projected increase in demand for tech-driven roles like Social Data Scientists and Ethical AI Specialists, even as 45% of traditional sociology-related roles now require proficiency in AI-enhanced data tools.", "image": null, "favicon": "https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=research.com&sz=64"}, {"title": "Academic and Policy Careers in Social Sciences Increasingly Demand Hybrid AI Skills", "source": "Academic Jobs", "url": "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH7xYhAKru6KcO1Aj7COKKgs5nWIybWnelkWe2efGuxzDGxbxfWFd49zZ5hMxce7nspNjWyJpUqsyO8Et95yd8R7gkMNZdwpnFZ4Or6sXhjTntzqU8KqtQAcsDOdGlyV9ChjtL8j0QpPVB2psH_7DxDxuxiBAceHHfGJFpg9pwRUg5BOttG0g0AQDcTq6uIY_6Q34YSaSC2hCk-DrMj_rnfFlDrqPunsBz0eX0EJpDuF_-E", "published": "2026-07-23", "summary": "The job market for social scientists is shifting toward hybrid roles that combine qualitative domain expertise with computational AI proficiency, prompting PhD programs to rapidly integrate AI ethics and computational data analysis into their curricula.", "image": null, "favicon": "https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=academicjobs.com&sz=64"}]}}, "Humanities": {"expires_at": 1785206866.550426, "feed": {"family": "Humanities", "fetched_at": "2026-07-27T20:47:46+00:00", "items": [{"title": "Why Humanities Majors Are 2026\u2019s Stealth Power Players In Tech", "source": "Forbes", "url": "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHM4964JuHrxxgZ7zN2Ed8LW1Fe83BxqRESOVR6qbsleckYf13BW6AqaJECahSXSHEcXKOUXNPhmnz2ZoksKFpXpn9E1ZkUfkGnx1Bku2133DSYf7sok9I4IFOQmDJYC8eiTK70E0crBNTN4HluMeHQ3NbMOyLlfDRu6amllr0gry0KxDGP7Vr36-rARB_CST641Nf6beRg_6KSpXMN9zHExX_8lrsLLp4lpQ==", "published": "2026-07-26", "summary": "As artificial intelligence rapidly automates technical tasks and niche specialist workflows, there is a surge in demand for humanities-centric skills like brand-building, storytelling, and persuasion. LinkedIn workforce data reveals that English and Social Science majors are currently finding clearer, more viable paths in the tech sector than specialized junior engineers because of their \"versatility quotient\" and ability to bridge the AI translation gap.", "image": "https://imageio.forbes.com/specials-images/imageserve/6a6309a6a90d2729eacafbb7/0x0.jpg?format=jpg&height=900&width=1600&fit=bounds", "favicon": "https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=forbes.com&sz=64"}, {"title": "Automation Pressure on Entry-Level Roles vs. Rise of Digital Humanities", "source": "Research.com", "url": "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGrmzbSZd8VqgLXo4WMUMoUfdoF-9B7apHWCxuSjUSQFAam_9L3mLPbbBbUidQH28ypJn-Pl3HapvQYmc8oluTtmlAcKswACPXBlytXOJZTlfzFcOY1MRyE4SlG_bAIww-Qrcv4fcKkSjbLlQMNsai7ooOBqOoKWoymjFudggmVnwQ2-CD-FVx6oURbhVN8Vc0=", "published": "2026-07-16", "summary": "While roughly 45% of traditional humanities-related tasks (such as basic content creation and routine copy drafting) face high automation risks, tech integration has created a 30% growth in specialized Ethical AI development and digital humanities roles. Employers are increasingly prioritizing digital literacy, interdisciplinary collaboration, and ethical storytelling, prompting humanities graduates to pivot toward tech-informed pedagogical and media-strategy roles.", "image": null, "favicon": "https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=research.com&sz=64"}, {"title": "Growing Academic Shifts and AI-Proof Paths", "source": "Academic Jobs", "url": "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEmgOZABokhUiHfH_3hO_-GN71SmXLvM4axkSTf488NKl26hK4-r-E9odzpsV3m3WGrkam6q4LmV9bPkIyVACK8PD9TaipHGm007F0fQ41whf2O4-ifiH7aUx8BmtNO--zJevVMBd7FRWTrsRau19IoT9iObIgP92C8LEW6n21Fkut3YTG37jh4TR-VLgCHLHQbg8rJKro7WEXhpkL55zS_NCYmaXnhh2RS1IlEB0L6QsduzCWVtw==", "published": "2026-07-23", "summary": "Driven by the rapid evolution of the workplace, Gallup data shows that 4 in 10 U.S. students are actively rethinking their majors, pushing universities and career counselors to outline clear, AI-proof pathways that focus on soft skills and human-centric teaching.", "image": null, "favicon": "https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=academicjobs.com&sz=64"}]}}, "Arts": {"expires_at": 1785206869.63227, "feed": {"family": "Arts", "fetched_at": "2026-07-27T20:47:49+00:00", "items": [{"title": "Why Humanities Majors Are 2026\u2019s Stealth Power Players In Tech", "source": "Forbes", "url": "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFcXhDUP3BML9VpyNZteYqe0PPEtnG0fd8LGtcEI3bn1drdtgBgmi1KAZ-i7aXyDjytieUi9HphoKHJfPwQAHVgN2H9NsSvtcz8mFXwTADeDAYocVSVs4Re5xo6glv-QoHkB_blmBylDKX1gahrBCfPKdB0tR9TzvzbhyrQ5pS-lBA3RRCu3mL16D2fihTH74V6qLS6cOgldjV1DCNveo1gFocconiQphEa7Q==", "published": "2026-07-26", "summary": "As AI automates technical and coding tasks, LinkedIn workforce data reveals that English, social science, and liberal arts majors are finding clearer career pathways in the tech sector than junior engineers. This shift is driving demand for \"soft degrees\" because humanities graduates excel at bridging the AI translation gap\u2014providing the crucial context, branding, persuasion, and emotional storytelling that AI cannot replicate.", "image": "https://imageio.forbes.com/specials-images/imageserve/6a6309a6a90d2729eacafbb7/0x0.jpg?format=jpg&height=900&width=1600&fit=bounds", "favicon": "https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=forbes.com&sz=64"}, {"title": "Emerging AI-Driven Career Paths in Art History and Curation", "source": "Research.com", "url": "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF75MZkQ_QgAPCWS-W_Q7wQgwkWLFMCLDA56OqwFtp3qi_6Gfa3O7Pe18u8DYYvFoGCzNl5PAKa-2yz2o3kDRqmhWfPHy42B9pjqbk_c1NfoQ-II26tQGkpAjyfFxX_5y12vJrvSd4ZUxCEAN0EYGC7l7aw6Ho3uZNhaqnrrPOo4QMtMtlp-ecte-HSkRfUB-Fq", "published": "2026-07-16", "summary": "Rather than eliminating roles, the integration of AI tools in cultural heritage and museum sectors has boosted the demand for art history and art studies graduates by 20% to 35% for specialized positions like \"Digital Curators\" and \"AI-Assisted Art Curators\" who combine visual analysis with data science. While routine archiving and cataloging are being automated, employers are increasingly willing to pay a premium for graduates who can utilize AI to manage digital collections and tailor audience engagement strategies.", "image": null, "favicon": "https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=research.com&sz=64"}, {"title": "Revenge of the Communicators: HR Teams Are Suddenly Scrambling for Good Liberal Arts Talent", "source": "Los Angeles Times", "url": "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGrEtmtdlTm2SVPk44YtzgZqM8kEW472jI6fPzirHNOAALjkPZNsDkzE9WvJD9Y-N6C0ZFjSQ5WNxLEAl7qEpLnyQjZsAxuEPoKnFPrcwUu4CDr3eGS36CE76QQ3o84WfBAQJe0ji543un7H4nU1ScbWMUWS6XSflbThaS0AWCuyzZiAAhnAXXS_-e8Eee-Jnj5tyTnqLNGyM6VYK4=", "published": "2026-04-19", "summary": "Companies ranging from major entertainment studios to tech startups are aggressively hiring liberal arts and communications graduates to handle nuanced human communication, branding, and narrative development. Organizations have realized that while generative AI can produce content cheaply, it lacks brand voice consistency and emotional intelligence, leading to a surge in internal communications and culture-building roles specifically targeting arts-background candidates.", "image": "https://ca-times.brightspotcdn.com/dims4/default/b798344/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1366x717+0+96/resize/1200x630!/quality/75/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcalifornia-times-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F03%2Fa4%2F8ab8fbfa40ef953f7344b0db225f%2Fliberal-arts.jpg", "favicon": "https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=latimes.com&sz=64"}]}}, "Trades": {"expires_at": 1785206887.301876, "feed": {"family": "Trades", "fetched_at": "2026-07-27T20:48:07+00:00", "items": [{"title": "U.S. Demand for Skilled Trades Grows 3x Faster than Professional Roles", "source": "Randstad USA", "url": "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFDVAByQf_15N1nzoea9b7QUAU6B_kly82QoQNtjKMSQAMRFnBczviVsNXCxitBKiHKkH0BIGkqcr0h6GvIEDTADV9cmm3tTWhFfu6ANvugNrtkvAv63WaywGkMeAE4l_GnkByFCzT5UK-1sO_psThrp248XMv-u5Vh6nLyf8gSKrEpXQdHTfpfjIAFy1uSuA1w8gxKea1B9z8SEw-Kk9c2Mc5xQcslRz0K-2VZyQPxqnCCYg==", "published": "2026-03-26", "summary": "While AI is automating desk jobs, the race to scale the physical infrastructure for artificial intelligence is fueling explosive hiring growth in the trades; between 2022 and 2026, job vacancies surged by 113.19% for robotics technicians, 77.89% for HVAC engineers, and 30% for general trades like electricians and welders.", "image": "https://www.randstadusa.com/s3fs-media/us/public/bynder/F89F427B-74F9-435F-847168C6F831C27C.webp", "favicon": "https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=randstadusa.com&sz=64"}, {"title": "Skilled Trades Survey 2026: How Gen Z Views AI & College", "source": "SimplyWise", "url": "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGS-QBENPuU_-2XYiW3cO_mir--_tHUEM6DQc1VCUrwpECnOTdHZGHkiAHPenjf47h2004_65O9t4mJvYxACOeLvRO83I1_ZlC5fYP84gMYR-I4lXg-gJvZ2CZfiJOoQkxTz3jscwVggD4lsdahYZF9ONtvHZMM", "published": "2026-06-02", "summary": "According to the June 2026 Trades & Technology Index survey, 52% of current college students believe skilled trades are safer than office jobs in an AI-dominated economy, with trades like HVAC and plumbing ranked by Gen Z as highly insulated from AI disruption.", "image": "https://www.simplywise.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/skilled-trades-survey-2026-social-card.png", "favicon": "https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=simplywise.com&sz=64"}, {"title": "Corporate Hiring Shifts Recruitment from White-Collar Grads to Skilled Trades", "source": "Profit Announcement", "url": "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE-GekJPF0QFtr0k3RhveArB6WmyTTUTitWWrYJ3xUXu4DNM9DW4pUAbJ_JIW8WWceuiCbStMnxa09y68Njaiqf0A8RWyFsVL6rBnFswYTgqfJhobkRQfOBm4VsVMkhB81BO9quv1y