I continues to struggle with nuanced human connection, generating thousands of hybrid internal messaging and brand strategy roles that require high-level soft skills.", "image": "https://ca-times.brightspotcdn.com/dims4/default/b798344/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1366x717+0+96/resize/1200x630!/quality/75/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcalifornia-times-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F03%2Fa4%2F8ab8fbfa40ef953f7344b0db225f%2Fliberal-arts.jpg", "favicon": "https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=latimes.com&sz=64"}]}}}
